### Stock
### post create stock POST/stock/stockcreate
POST {{Base_url}}/stock/stockcreate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "symbol": "CPALL",
    "companyName":"CP",
    "exchange":"set50",
    "currency":"baht",
    "logo":"",
    "inductry":""
}


### Get stocks GEt/stock/stocks
Get {{Base_url}}/stock/stocks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Get stocksBySymbol GET/stock/stocks/:symbol
GET {{Base_url}}/stock/stocks/GOOGL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET search stock    GET/stock/stocks?search=Alphabet
GET {{Base_url}}/stock/stocks?search=Alphabet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### PATCH Stock        PATCH/stock/stocks/:id
PATCH {{Base_url}}/stock/stocks/{{stockId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "companyName":"Alphabet Inc",
    "exchange":"NASDAQ",
    "currency":"USD",
    "logo":"",
    "industry":""
}


### PATCH updateStockStatus      PATCH/stock/stocks/:id/status
PATCH {{Base_url}}/stock/stocks/{{stockId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "isActive":true
}

